{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "HYPERBLADE",
    "steam_appid": 1834740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/58e0d2c7afdc4534ee3814ba342f1dec.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/58e0d2c7afdc4534ee3814ba342f1dec.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/58e0d2c7afdc4534ee3814ba342f1dec.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>HYPERBLADE</strong> is a gameplay-driven action game where you can only move by dashing. <br>Use your momentum to kick off walls and cut down your enemies. <br>Abilities like time manipulation and bullet deflection allow for limitless improvisational play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/d32ab46b4069a3a04b570dd1a432a2d8.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/d32ab46b4069a3a04b570dd1a432a2d8.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/d32ab46b4069a3a04b570dd1a432a2d8.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2>HYPERBLADE has entered early access to get feedback and improve the game. The final version will expand on the story/lore, and have more levels and gameplay elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/23b2e5ca67406ea05690f3ca63e71ef4.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/23b2e5ca67406ea05690f3ca63e71ef4.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/23b2e5ca67406ea05690f3ca63e71ef4.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Design Pillars</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gameplay first - HYPERBLADE prioritizes gameplay over story. No long unskippable cutscenes to interrupt the flow of gameplay.<br></li><li> Tough but fair - Players should feel challenged, but should never feel that they died unfairly.<br></li><li> A sense of mastery - A player's skill should improve over time. The satisfaction of mastering a mechanic can be extremely satisfying.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/12cd0b75a3286b303c019bf51a45091e.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/12cd0b75a3286b303c019bf51a45091e.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/12cd0b75a3286b303c019bf51a45091e.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/58e0d2c7afdc4534ee3814ba342f1dec.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/58e0d2c7afdc4534ee3814ba342f1dec.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/58e0d2c7afdc4534ee3814ba342f1dec.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>HYPERBLADE</strong> is a gameplay-driven action game where you can only move by dashing. <br>Use your momentum to kick off walls and cut down your enemies. <br>Abilities like time manipulation and bullet deflection allow for limitless improvisational play.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/d32ab46b4069a3a04b570dd1a432a2d8.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/d32ab46b4069a3a04b570dd1a432a2d8.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/d32ab46b4069a3a04b570dd1a432a2d8.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access</h2>HYPERBLADE has entered early access to get feedback and improve the game. The final version will expand on the story/lore, and have more levels and gameplay elements.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/23b2e5ca67406ea05690f3ca63e71ef4.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/23b2e5ca67406ea05690f3ca63e71ef4.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/23b2e5ca67406ea05690f3ca63e71ef4.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Design Pillars</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gameplay first - HYPERBLADE prioritizes gameplay over story. No long unskippable cutscenes to interrupt the flow of gameplay.<br></li><li> Tough but fair - Players should feel challenged, but should never feel that they died unfairly.<br></li><li> A sense of mastery - A player's skill should improve over time. The satisfaction of mastering a mechanic can be extremely satisfying.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/12cd0b75a3286b303c019bf51a45091e.poster.avif?t=1747499819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/12cd0b75a3286b303c019bf51a45091e.webm?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1834740/extras/12cd0b75a3286b303c019bf51a45091e.mp4?t=1747499819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
